  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [webpack-hot-middleware](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware) from `v2.20.0` to `v2.21.2`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v2.21.0\n-   [`920248d`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/920248deef0e742c6bcea7457a8a74d44fa7ee79) Update deprecated package\n-   [`8ece2d2`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/8ece2d2760073e7ee7bfbace36a9fca1a7054b94) Fix bundle js reference\n-   [`d2cb88a`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/d2cb88adb0e45c7f31835ef239257e51e4bb513a) Allow for custom colors and custom overlay styling\n-   [`3e1db24`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/3e1db243c02944ab5e9cd2f600568b14dab0baa2) Update readme\n-   [`3e6d99a`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/3e6d99a8be81659018f78d09f000f9cbb927f823) Merge pull request #&#8203;264 from okcoker/feature/custom-client-colors\n-   [`d8b3d18`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/d8b3d189bf9e7de9970a94d6c0a69bba97fb5308) Bump package-lock.json, because that&#x27;s a thing apparently?\n-   [`3591ea8`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/3591ea8a351364815ea459b060d865c044fed955) 2.21.0\n#### v2.21.1\n-   [`319c565`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/319c565a764c1de2f6e590fa26919b40999c1977) update README with koa-webpack\n-   [`6086db2`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/6086db22e0bc3933377dc96fff3b81e11c234fe3) Merge pull request #&#8203;276 from shellscape/master\n-   [`757cb54`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/757cb547e616f119aa6867add86b450e8c106e57) koa-webpack no longer depends on this module\n-   [`5cdf04b`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/5cdf04be63b5c1dd9df6d9dd2daabc030afd1141) Merge pull request #&#8203;282 from olsonpm/fix-readme\n-   [`43c3a0e`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/43c3a0e86a1c51c2338f8c3a49e22462bf2fcc77) Update README.md\n-   [`a257b08`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/a257b08126ab0556986f9a43a2ee1b151c487cf0) Merge pull request #&#8203;285 from kagawagao/master\n-   [`9890dcc`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/9890dccce96bda9165f1bb0dd35ef849989c1cc9) fixed call to bundle file in example\n-   [`dfd30d6`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/dfd30d6940c1ed89f6c5bbf8ced354c715b53973) Merge pull request #&#8203;286 from silverlight513/example-fix\n-   [`e052aed`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/e052aedc6956defe27eccd929969a8811a8bcafb) Support plugin API of webpack v3 and v4\n-   [`2da2e24`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/2da2e24f8da52d7eed374ba4182f84b4c9c15cc2) Upgrade example to webpack v4\n-   [`ae79f6a`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/ae79f6a143e12e50cbb160b6bda293dfdb28b071) 2.21.1\n#### v2.21.2\n-   [`5e7112f`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/5e7112f35b5a1e18fd52b24b2b038a9901ffb2f7) use &#x27;invalid&#x27; hook instead\n-   [`6b756cc`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/6b756cc359ee737c2bdc3f8d3e0d6606d9f527e2) Merge pull request #&#8203;288 from qazbnm456/master\n-   [`7837da1`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/7837da1001f466cfc709c5b8eefaf6b1e4021498) refactor: use native url lib\n-   [`c975a09`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/c975a0952a044c1acb7ab423ff62b24867a11319) Merge pull request #&#8203;289 from Runrioter/master\n-   [`7bc3f34`](https://github.com/glenjamin/webpack-hot-middleware/commit/7bc3f3443aaf3f4d3ebb7edbfc1da4bf8920ffdb) 2.21.2\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
